 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? Pop tarts, sandwich toast, cheese and crackers, fruit and yoghurt. Then sandwich toast is nice and easy. Then sandwich toast is nice and easy. Squeeze some fruit jam in each corner and spread cheese in the middle. A bag of mixed nuts is good, or a small box of chocolates. Keep them in separate compartments so they don't get crushed. If space allows, it' polite to share plate space with others. A large sandwich box does this. If space is tight, only if you' the only one eating. Use a thin plate so it fits.",
